# Shared secret proving a request to the app actually came through the
# mTLS gateway (nginx/mtls-gateway.conf.template) rather than being sent
# directly to :3000 with forged X-SSL-Client-* headers. Required for the
# mTLS gateway to work at all - MTLSMiddleware rejects every request when
# this is unset. Generate one with: openssl rand -hex 32
#
# Must be set to the SAME value in two places:
#   1. A .env file here (docker compose reads it automatically for the
#      mtls-gateway service)
#   2. The shell environment that runs the app (`npm run start` / `start:dev`)
MTLS_GATEWAY_SECRET=
